# The images are built from the Go module and, for the host image, the
# host/ package's sources. Everything below is a build output, a local
# configuration, or another toolchain's installed tree, and none of it
# reaches an image; leaving it out keeps the context small and keeps a stale
# local build from being mistaken for the one the image made.
.git
/bin
/dist
host/node_modules
host/dist
host/bundle
deploy/**/.env
scripts/*.env
**/*.test
**/*.out
